Now, I'm trying to have a "for" loop cycle thru several columns in a
data frame to put several boxplots on the same graphic with
par(mfrow=c(2,3)), however the result of paste() does give me the data
in the corresponding column but only the name of the column. For
example, I've tried to get boxplots for several exams sequentially
numbered from one to six with:

for (i in 1:6) {
   boxplot(paste("data$Examen.", i, sep=""))
}

but it results in an error. If I put in boxplot(data$Examen.1) it
works, but the result of paste() doesn't. I've tried using
as.numeric() on the result of paste() but that's doesn't help.

Any clues? Thanks again for your help. Earl Brown

